schema.json is derived from the OpenAI Codex app-server protocol schema.

It is generated by scripts/vendor-codex.sh, which runs `codex app-server generate-json-schema`
against the build named in PIN and keeps, for each type mango-agent-codex speaks, that build's
declared field names and enum values. No OpenAI source code is vendored here; what is kept is the
vendor's own machine-readable description of its wire format, reduced to the names this harness
depends on.

